        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Le rythme qu’il crée en tapant avec son bâton très spécial génère des ondes sonores qui ont le pouvoir de vivifier les plantes.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "When it uses its special stick to strike up a beat, the sound waves produced carry revitalizing energy to the plants and flowers in the area.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "特別な　スティックで　リズムを 刻むと　草花を　元気にする パワーが　音波になって　広がる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
